Before returning, privately compare each source fact against its evidence span one by one. Confirm: all facts are present; no absent fact appears; no polarity, connector, number, unit, qualifier, or pre/post state changed; initial and recurrent wheeze remain separate; general and diarrhoea drinking remain separate; every evidence span is verbatim.

